    <section class="border-yellow border-b-8 mt-4 mb-10" id="video-allocations">
      <h2 class="mb-3">ACCESS Allocations</h2>

      <div class="md--w-9/12 border border-black mb-5">
        <iframe width="100%" style="aspect-ratio: 16/9"
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?si=R_sNMCqPMQ6_nfMW&amp;list=PLKZ5k-XFFHU0vvOEkvlFkCUJIUqiO653j"
          title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
          allowfullscreen=""></iframe>
      </div>
      <div class="md--w-9/12 mb-10">
        <h3 class="my-0">Watch the whole playlist or jump to a topic in the videos below.</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md--grid-cols-3 gap-10 mb-5">
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-start my-4 ">
          <p class="border border-black">
            <iframe width="100%" style="aspect-ratio: 16/9"
              src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/lhjPw7ZJ7Ak?si=7xjjl-GvvFjaPGEo"
              title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0"
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
              allowfullscreen="">
            </iframe>
          </p>
          <h4 class="mt-0">The Allocations Portal</h4>
          <p>Watch a brief overview of the ACCESS Allocations portal: <a
              href="https://allocations.access-ci.org/">https://allocations.access-ci.org/</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-start my-4">
          <p class="border border-black">
            <iframe width="100%" style="aspect-ratio: 16/9"
              src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/vvj5nL1lFxA?si=AVSG2K_m4VxozdKJ"
              title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0"
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
              allowfullscreen="">
            </iframe>
          </p>
          <h4 class="mt-0">Preparing Allocation Requests</h4>
          <p>Find out about the different kinds of projects listed under the
            Prepare Requests menu on the ACCESS Allocations portal: <a
              href="https://allocations.access-ci.org/">https://allocations.access-ci.org/</a>,
            including Explore, Discover, Accelerate, and Maximize projects.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-start my-4 ">
          <p class="border border-black">
            <iframe width="100%" style="aspect-ratio: 16/9"
              src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/j3DbxS5f2Jc?si=ouT5cH0xLcA0j9lZ"
              title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0"
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
              allowfullscreen="">
            </iframe>
          </p>
          <h4 class="mt-0">Allocation Request Demo</h4>
          <p>Watch a walk-through of the process of preparing and submitting an
            Allocation Request via the ACCESS Allocations portal: <a
              href="https://allocations.access-ci.org/">https://allocations.access-ci.org/</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-start my-4 ">
          <p class="border border-black">
            <iframe width="100%" style="aspect-ratio: 16/9"
              src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/z-NEEuQxx7g?si=Z_RnlFwS7oUbQhNh"
              title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0"
              allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
              allowfullscreen="">
            </iframe>
          </p>
